SCOPE OF THE GPL IN THIS REPOSITORY
===================================

Repository: https://github.com/AlexZ1212/chang64
Site:       https://chang64.com

The GNU General Public License v3, whose full text is in the file LICENSE, applies to
the PROGRAM: the chess engine, the user interface, the build scripts, the service
worker, and every other piece of executable code in this repository.

It does NOT apply to the editorial and creative material distributed alongside the
program. The following remain the exclusive property of the author and are not
licensed for reuse:

  1. The written content of the site's pages in English and French: opening notes,
     rule explanations, glossary entries, endgame commentary, trap descriptions, and
     all accompanying prose.

  2. The tactics puzzle collection as a curated set, together with its themes,
     difficulty calibration and ordering.

  3. The visual identity: the chang64 name, the elephant mark, the logotype, the
     chess piece artwork, and the colour and typography system.

  4. The Open Graph share images generated from the above.

Anyone exercising their rights under the GPL is free to take the program. To publish a
derivative site, replace the material listed above with your own.

